        "sid": "HEB 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, while the promise of entering his rest remains, let us fear lest any of you be judged to have failed to reach it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For good news came to us just as to them; but the message which they heard did not benefit them, because it did not meet with faith in the hearers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other manuscripts read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they were not united in faith with the hearers",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ps 95.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For we who have believed enter that rest, as he has said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us therefore strive to enter that rest, that no one fall by the same sort of disobedience. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the word of God is living and active, sharper than any two-edged sword, piercing to the division of soul and spirit, of joints and marrow, and discerning the thoughts and intentions of the heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And before him no creature is hidden, but all are open and laid bare to the eyes of him with whom we have to do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Since then we have a great high priest who has passed through the heavens, Jesus, the Son of God, let us hold fast our confession. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For we have not a high priest who is unable to sympathize with our weaknesses, but one who in every respect has been tempted as we are, yet without sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us then with confidence draw near to the throne of grace, that we may receive mercy and find grace to help in time of need.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
